B.BN=new A.cw("Banricard Multi","Aplicaci\xf3n de la tarjeta Banricard Multibeneficios: consulta de los saldos de las carteras de beneficios, extracto y compras realizadas, desbloqueo de la tarjeta, consulta y cambio de contrase\xf1a, bloqueo en caso de p\xe9rdida o robo y aprobaci\xf3n de la tarjeta virtual.",u.B,u.z,null,null,"assets/screens/banricard-multi.webp")
B.BO=new A.cw("Volunt\xe1rio Conectado","Plattform f\xfcr Sozialtechnologie, die Freiwillige mit gemeinn\xfctzigen Organisationen verbindet, mit einem Spring-Boot-Backend und einer plattform\xfcbergreifenden Flutter-Anwendung. Entwickelt im Rahmen des problembasierten Lernens (PBL) im Masterstudiengang Software Engineering der CESAR School und beim INPI registriert, das die Urheberschaft \xfcber einen kryptografischen Hash des Quellcodes sichert.",null,null,u.X,"Projektseite",null)
B.BP=new A.cw("Volunt\xe1rio Conectado","A social technology platform designed to connect volunteers with non-profit organizations, built with a Spring Boot backend and a Flutter multiplatform application. Developed as part of a Problem-Based Learning (PBL) course in the Master's Degree in Software Engineering at CESAR School and officially registered with the INPI, ensuring authorship through a cryptographic hash of the source code.",null,null,u.X,"Project website",null)
B.BQ=new A.cw("CheckGo \u2014 Selbstbedienung f\xfcr Private-Label-Kreditkarten","Selbstbedienungs-Kioskanwendung mit Rechnungszahlung per PIX und Debitkarte, Abfrage von Guthaben und Kreditlimit, Karten- und Ratenverwaltung, Versicherungsabschluss, digitalem Onboarding, Passwort\xe4nderung und Schuldentilgung.",null,null,null,null,null)
B.BR=new A.cw("MOAI \u2014 Autoservicio para pedidos de comida","Aplicaci\xf3n de quiosco de autoservicio para el comercio minorista, en la que el propio cliente navega por los productos, arma el pedido y concluye la compra mediante una interfaz t\xe1ctil.",null,null,u._,"Art\xedculo",null)
B.BS=new A.cw("Selic Agora","Aplicativo para acompanhar a taxa Selic, com gr\xe1fico do hist\xf3rico, sele\xe7\xe3o de intervalo de datas e explica\xe7\xe3o sobre o indicador, com dados do Banco Central. Dispon\xedvel em portugu\xeas e ingl\xeas.",u.M,null,null,null,"assets/screens/selic-agora.webp")
B.BT=new A.cw("MOAI \u2014 Self-checkout app for private label credit cards","Self-service kiosk application featuring debit card bill payments, debt settlement and renegotiation, customer onboarding, facial recognition and promotional image carousels for in-store advertising. Enhanced customer autonomy while streamlining financial services and providing an additional channel for marketing campaigns.",null,null,u._,"Article",null)
B.BU=new A.cw("Volunt\xe1rio Conectado","Plataforma de tecnolog\xeda social que conecta voluntarios con organizaciones sin fines de lucro, con backend en Spring Boot y aplicaci\xf3n multiplataforma en Flutter. Desarrollada en la asignatura de Aprendizaje Basado en Problemas (PBL) del M\xe1ster en Ingenier\xeda de Software de CESAR School y registrada en el INPI, que garantiza la autor\xeda mediante un hash criptogr\xe1fico del c\xf3digo fuente.",null,null,u.X,"Sitio del proyecto",null)
B.BV=new A.cw("CheckGo \u2014 Self-checkout app for private label credit cards","Self-service kiosk application featuring bill payments via PIX and debit card, balance and credit limit inquiries, card and installment plan management, insurance enrollment, digital onboarding, password changes and debt settlement.",null,null,null,null,null)
B.BW=new A.cw("Selic Agora","App for following the Brazilian Selic interest rate, with a chart of its history, date range selection and an explanation of the indicator, using Central Bank data. Available in Portuguese and English.",u.M,null,null,null,"assets/screens/selic-agora.webp")
